  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0242_c8f4a5aca7dc.png\" style=\"width: 251px; height: 250px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0242_9ff04e96c127.png\" /></p><p>Consider small volume element between <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br />Resistance of this volume along rational directions,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />As all element resistance are in series,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
